From: WorkBuddy AI <buddy@workbuddy>
Date: Thu, 30 Jul 2026 21:10:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 12] fix: compile stm32_rifsc.c unconditionally in SPE targets

The linker error `undefined reference to __device_dts_ord_33` occurs
because RNG's access-controllers DT property references rifsc (ordinal
33), but stm32_rifsc.c was guarded by $<BOOL:${STM32_M33TDCID}> in
the SPE targets (platform_s, tfm_s). On D-variant chips where TDCID=OFF,
the rifsc device is never defined, causing link failure.

stm32_rifsc.c has no compile-time dependency on STM32_M33TDCID; it only
uses IS_ENABLED(STM32_M33TDCID) for runtime checks, which is safe to
compile unconditionally.

Fix: Remove the TDCID guard from stm32_rifsc.c for platform_s and tfm_s
targets. BL2 targets (platform_bl2, bl2) were already unconditional.

Signed-off-by: WorkBuddy AI <buddy@workbuddy>
---
 platform/ext/target/stm/common/stm32mp2xx/CMakeLists.txt | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/platform/ext/target/stm/common/stm32mp2xx/CMakeLists.txt b/platform/ext/target/stm/common/stm32mp2xx/CMakeLists.txt
index 042059c..72a3f1b 100644
--- a/platform/ext/target/stm/common/stm32mp2xx/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/platform/ext/target/stm/common/stm32mp2xx/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -144,7 +144,7 @@
 		$<$<BOOL:${TFM_PLATFORM_CPU_API}>:${STM_FAMILY_DIR}/secure/services/src/tfm_ioctl_cpu_api.c>
 		$<$<BOOL:${TFM_PLATFORM_CPU_API}>:${STM_FAMILY_DIR}/secure/services/src/cpus.c>
 		$<$<BOOL:${STM32_M33TDCID}>:${STM_FAMILY_DIR}/native_driver/src/power/stm32mp2_pwr.c>
-		$<$<BOOL:${STM32_M33TDCID}>:${STM_FAMILY_DIR}/native_driver/src/rif/stm32_rifsc.c>
+		${STM_FAMILY_DIR}/native_driver/src/rif/stm32_rifsc.c
 		$<$<BOOL:${STM32_M33TDCID}>:${STM_FAMILY_DIR}/native_driver/src/rif/stm32_risaf.c>
 		$<$<BOOL:${STM32_M33TDCID}>:${STM_FAMILY_DIR}/native_driver/src/rif/stm32_risab.c>
 		$<$<BOOL:${STM32_M33TDCID}>:${STM_FAMILY_DIR}/native_driver/src/rif/stm32_iac.c>
@@ -253,7 +253,7 @@
         $<$<BOOL:${TFM_PLATFORM_WDT_API}>:${STM_FAMILY_DIR}/secure/services/src/wdt.c>
         $<$<BOOL:${TFM_PLATFORM_CPU_API}>:${STM_FAMILY_DIR}/secure/services/src/cpus.c>
         $<$<BOOL:${STM32_M33TDCID}>:${STM_FAMILY_DIR}/native_driver/src/power/stm32mp2_pwr.c>
-        $<$<BOOL:${STM32_M33TDCID}>:${STM_FAMILY_DIR}/native_driver/src/rif/stm32_rifsc.c>
+        ${STM_FAMILY_DIR}/native_driver/src/rif/stm32_rifsc.c
         $<$<BOOL:${STM32_M33TDCID}>:${STM_FAMILY_DIR}/native_driver/src/rif/stm32_risaf.c>
         $<$<BOOL:${STM32_M33TDCID}>:${STM_FAMILY_DIR}/native_driver/src/rif/stm32_risab.c>
 	$<$<BOOL:${STM32_M33TDCID}>:${STM_FAMILY_DIR}/native_driver/src/crypto/stm32_saes.c>
